1
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:06,400
No...

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,360
Not him, either.

3
00:00:09,090 --> 00:00:10,820
Aw, man...

4
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:13,800
What is up with this level?

5
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:18,250
I was so sure the final boss would be here.

6
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:23,250
Could it be one of those events with no actual boss fight 
and focuses on group battles instead?

7
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:27,400
Well, guess I'll check underground, 
just in case.

8
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:33,900
If there's nothing there, I'll pick up 
the rest of the gold coins and head home.

