898
00:02:07,010 --> 00:02:12,040
The Hour of Awakening

899
00:02:11,290 --> 00:02:12,460
Where's Cid?!

900
00:02:12,460 --> 00:02:14,200
Cid, where are you?!

901
00:02:12,460 --> 00:02:14,200
Queen Elisabeth!

902
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:14,910
Cid!

903
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:16,870
Who the hell is that?!

904
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:19,170
I don't sense Crimson's presence anymore.

905
00:02:17,490 --> 00:02:20,100
Does this mean Cid wasn't the sacrifice?

906
00:02:19,170 --> 00:02:20,350
And the coffin is gone.

907
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:22,830
Seriously, that boy does nothing 
but worry me!

908
00:02:20,350 --> 00:02:21,750
What happened here?

909
00:02:22,830 --> 00:02:25,290
Oh, man! I need to get back 
to town right now!

910
00:02:23,090 --> 00:02:24,500
Claire, look out!

911
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:33,100
Cid...

912
00:02:35,710 --> 00:02:37,260
Claire...

913
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:53,030
Oh, no...

914
00:02:53,710 --> 00:02:55,600
Queen Elisabeth!

915
00:02:59,810 --> 00:03:01,700
I was too late...

916
00:03:02,210 --> 00:03:03,400
Claire!

917
00:03:06,830 --> 00:03:09,330
No, please don't, Queen Elisabeth!

918
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:25,800
Target secured!

919
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:38,300
Queen Elisabeth...

920
00:03:41,130 --> 00:03:42,600
It's you...

921
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:43,490
How is she?

922
00:03:43,490 --> 00:03:47,500
She's still breathing, but I'm not sure 
emergency first aid will be enough.

923
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:48,620
I see.

924
00:03:49,310 --> 00:03:52,250
However, it doesn't look like 
we'll be able to beat a hasty retreat.

925
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:55,880
Our lord and master has yet 
to reveal himself.

926
00:03:55,880 --> 00:04:00,220
That means he has some higher priority, 
a grander purpose to achieve first.

927
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:04,180
In other words, he has trusted me 
to handle this situation.

928
00:04:04,180 --> 00:04:08,380
My lord's sister is dying. 
I cannot allow her life to be lost.

929
00:04:08,380 --> 00:04:10,440
I must finish this quickly.

930
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:12,610
Number 664, continue to care for her.

931
00:04:12,610 --> 00:04:15,190
665 and 666, cover me!

932
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:15,800
Right!

933
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,210
You got it!

934
00:04:27,790 --> 00:04:28,840
Her flesh?

935
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:30,800
I can't move...

936
00:04:37,130 --> 00:04:38,220
Take this!

937
00:04:45,110 --> 00:04:46,140
It's no use.

938
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:49,790
I admit, you people are strong.

939
00:04:49,790 --> 00:04:51,400
But my lady...

940
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:54,070
My queen has always...

941
00:04:54,810 --> 00:04:57,030
been a slow riser due to low blood pressure!

942
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,500
This magical energy...

943
00:05:01,500 --> 00:05:02,910
It's greater than Lady Alpha's?

944
00:05:03,310 --> 00:05:04,750
My, my...

945
00:05:04,750 --> 00:05:06,870
You look like such a darling little thing.

946
00:05:06,870 --> 00:05:09,830
But quite the monster, aren't you?

947
00:05:09,830 --> 00:05:13,400
I shall have to time my departure carefully.

948
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:22,300
Quit having so much fun without inviting me!

949
00:05:23,500 --> 00:05:24,990
That's...

950
00:05:24,990 --> 00:05:26,640
Juggernaut of the Black Tower.

951
00:05:28,100 --> 00:05:29,800
You little...

952
00:05:34,900 --> 00:05:36,700
That bitch...

953
00:05:37,250 --> 00:05:39,540
What do you think are you doing?

954
00:05:39,540 --> 00:05:40,590
Shut up!

955
00:05:49,010 --> 00:05:50,660
Protect Miss Claire!

956
00:05:58,910 --> 00:06:00,590
Dammit all to hell!

957
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:10,520
Dammit...

958
00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:13,700
You went out of your way to take 
the full brunt of it? Are you that stupid?

959
00:06:13,700 --> 00:06:15,410
Can it, she-fox!

960
00:06:15,410 --> 00:06:16,020
Ow!

961
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:18,900
Aw, crap. It's broken.

962
00:06:19,300 --> 00:06:21,710
Well, he won't be of much help.

963
00:06:21,710 --> 00:06:23,530
What about them?

964
00:06:26,170 --> 00:06:28,000
Queen Elisabeth...

965
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,300
She's not yet...

966
00:06:31,110 --> 00:06:32,610
You're hurt...

967
00:06:32,610 --> 00:06:34,200
I'm fine.

968
00:06:37,500 --> 00:06:38,920
She's all right.

969
00:06:40,630 --> 00:06:44,590
She's expended all that magical energy, 
yet shows no signs of fatigue.

970
00:06:45,210 --> 00:06:46,900
Quite the contrary.

971
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:50,600
She's taking our blood, and healing herself.

972
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,220
No...

973
00:06:53,010 --> 00:06:54,980
She's making herself even more powerful.

974
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:58,810
Number 666, take Miss Claire 
and get out of here.

975
00:06:58,810 --> 00:07:00,690
No, I can still...

976
00:07:00,690 --> 00:07:03,400
You have things you need to do, don't you?

977
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:06,900
Right now, your priority is to stay alive.

978
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,300
Impossible...

979
00:07:23,290 --> 00:07:24,840
Our possessed blood...

980
00:07:25,500 --> 00:07:28,010
She's controlling the blood of the Demon?

981
00:07:30,310 --> 00:07:33,800
How dare she spit 
in the face of Lord Shadow's blessing?

982
00:07:37,110 --> 00:07:38,540
Miss Claire?

983
00:07:38,540 --> 00:07:39,370
Miss Claire!

984
00:07:40,310 --> 00:07:41,500
Miss Claire!

985
00:07:44,030 --> 00:07:49,990
Claire

986
00:07:54,420 --> 00:07:55,800
Are you awake?

987
00:07:58,200 --> 00:07:59,420
Possession...

988
00:07:59,420 --> 00:08:02,590
Those symptoms that have been 
causing you so much anxiety...

989
00:08:02,590 --> 00:08:05,040
You were fully cured long ago.

990
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:07,380
After all, <i>he</i> knows everything.

991
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,590
I'm cured?

992
00:08:09,590 --> 00:08:12,850
My possession... is gone?

993
00:08:12,850 --> 00:08:14,090
Who is "he"?

994
00:08:14,090 --> 00:08:16,210
Someone you know very well.

995
00:08:16,210 --> 00:08:17,840
But I don't.

996
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:20,300
What're you talking about? What's going on?

997
00:08:20,300 --> 00:08:25,360
To put it simply, you are adapting 
but have lost control, unfortunately.

998
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:28,300
Very soon, your body will turn 
into a rotting mess.

999
00:08:28,900 --> 00:08:31,600
So, I'm going to give you 
just enough helpâ

1000
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:33,100
You're not making any sense!

1001
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:36,040
I have absolutely no idea what is happening!

1002
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:38,400
Where am I? Who are you?

1003
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,700
And who in the world is this "he" person?!

1004
00:08:41,310 --> 00:08:43,000
An awful lot of questions.

1005
00:08:43,500 --> 00:08:47,010
Perhaps a negative side effect 
of relaxed education policies?

1006
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:50,600
This is going to take some explaining.

1007
00:08:55,010 --> 00:08:55,010


1008
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:02,440
Have you heard of "evolution"?

1009
00:09:02,700 --> 00:09:07,470
It's a theory proposed by one scientist suggesting 
that people used to be monkeys.

1010
00:09:07,470 --> 00:09:12,670
After many long years, those monkeys adapted 
to their environment and became humans.

1011
00:09:12,670 --> 00:09:14,290
What're you talking about?

1012
00:09:14,290 --> 00:09:16,510
What does it have to do 
with my current situation?

1013
00:09:16,510 --> 00:09:23,380
But then, another scientist came along and declared 
that living creatures do not adapt to their environment.

1014
00:09:23,620 --> 00:09:28,300
In their harsh natural surroundings, only the smartest monkeys survived

1015
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:29,670
and eventually became humans.

1016
00:09:29,670 --> 00:09:31,850
I said, what are you talking about?

1017
00:09:31,850 --> 00:09:36,250
In other words, the monkeys 
did not adapt intentionally.

1018
00:09:36,250 --> 00:09:41,350
The ones that happened to already be adapted 
to their habitat survived and changed physically.

1019
00:09:41,350 --> 00:09:42,800
And then...

1020
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,340
What were we talking about?

1021
00:09:45,340 --> 00:09:46,860
I have no idea.

1022
00:09:46,860 --> 00:09:47,940
Oh, right!

1023
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:50,000
We were discussing adaptation.

1024
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:55,320
The point is, the fact that the blood has divided 
into two different types is another one of its results.

1025
00:09:55,750 --> 00:09:58,210
Possessed and Progenitor Vampires...

1026
00:09:58,210 --> 00:10:02,900
The bloodline split into two, 
and the characteristics of each are clearly differentiated.

1027
00:10:04,460 --> 00:10:09,800
And now, those two types of blood 
are trying to adapt inside of you.

1028
00:10:11,670 --> 00:10:14,600
Unfortunately, 
you have the right constitution.

1029
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:19,270
But you do not know how to control it, 
which makes it even more tragic.

1030
00:10:19,620 --> 00:10:23,300
That is why the blood has gone berserk, 
and your body is...

1031
00:10:23,910 --> 00:10:26,400
Oh, it is just about time.

1032
00:10:27,370 --> 00:10:30,250
Wait! You were about 
to say something important!

1033
00:10:34,310 --> 00:10:35,700
What is this?

1034
00:10:35,700 --> 00:10:38,870
It will teach you 
how to control your powers.

1035
00:10:38,870 --> 00:10:40,500
Can you explain it a little moreâ

1036
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:41,800
We have no time.

1037
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:44,120
Things are getting a little hectic outside.

1038
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:45,840
Come back!

1039
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:47,790
Who are you and what're you planning?

1040
00:10:48,100 --> 00:10:50,300
Why are you helping...

1041
00:10:50,900 --> 00:10:52,260
<i>Are</i> you helping me?

1042
00:10:52,690 --> 00:10:54,450
I am Aurora.

1043
00:10:54,450 --> 00:10:57,800
And I helped you because you are <i>his</i>.

1044
00:10:57,800 --> 00:10:59,720
But who is "he"?!

1045
00:11:00,590 --> 00:11:01,680
Shadow.

1046
00:11:02,090 --> 00:11:03,290
Shadow?

1047
00:11:11,100 --> 00:11:13,390
But how...

1048
00:11:14,510 --> 00:11:16,900
Claire, is that you?

1049
00:11:22,090 --> 00:11:24,500
My first taste of freedom in a month!

1050
00:11:24,500 --> 00:11:26,300
The Witch of Calamity...

1051
00:11:27,290 --> 00:11:29,200
Why are you here?

1052
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,790
What happened to Claire?

1053
00:11:30,790 --> 00:11:31,900
Claire?

1054
00:11:31,900 --> 00:11:33,750
Oh, you mean the way I look?

1055
00:11:34,010 --> 00:11:36,510
It's the same as what he does.

1056
00:11:36,510 --> 00:11:38,900
But it's just easier to move 
with my usual physique.

1057
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:42,700
Oh, and the change of color isn't magic, 
it's the reflection of the light...

1058
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,900
A little too tight...

1059
00:11:46,690 --> 00:11:47,700
That's better.

1060
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:50,110
Now, then...

1061
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:53,900
How much of this can you handle?

1062
00:11:56,110 --> 00:11:57,600
Sorry...

1063
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:59,370
but I'm the original.

1064
00:12:03,110 --> 00:12:04,300
How...

1065
00:12:04,300 --> 00:12:09,250
Stealing control of blood 
that has left the body is not hard to do.

1066
00:12:09,540 --> 00:12:11,250
As you can see.

1067
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,340
Oh, you are lively!

1068
00:12:18,340 --> 00:12:20,300
That's how you young people should be!

1069
00:12:26,230 --> 00:12:28,800
Oh, come on. Like anything goes?

1070
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:31,190
It is rather over the top.

1071
00:12:34,230 --> 00:12:39,200
As a bonus, I will show you 
the most almighty power in the world!

1072
00:12:41,710 --> 00:12:42,890
What is this?

1073
00:12:45,620 --> 00:12:47,120
W-Wait!

1074
00:12:47,460 --> 00:12:49,000
You wouldn't!

1075
00:12:49,540 --> 00:12:51,200
I...

1076
00:12:51,820 --> 00:12:53,540
am the...

1077
00:12:53,890 --> 00:12:55,500
all...

1078
00:13:02,100 --> 00:13:03,250
Oh, dear.

1079
00:13:03,250 --> 00:13:05,310
Looks like this body could not handle it.

1080
00:13:05,310 --> 00:13:06,390
Excuse me?!

1081
00:13:06,790 --> 00:13:09,210
A little thing like this 
will heal in no time.

1082
00:13:09,210 --> 00:13:10,810
You can do it too, can't you?

1083
00:13:10,810 --> 00:13:12,110
I can <i>what</i>?

1084
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,040
Not again!

1085
00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:17,250
It's fine.

1086
00:13:17,250 --> 00:13:18,900
This is enough.

1087
00:13:19,690 --> 00:13:21,910
My work here is done.

1088
00:13:21,910 --> 00:13:25,240
I was only buying time until <i>he</i> arrived.

1089
00:13:25,500 --> 00:13:26,800
"He"?

1090
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,840
Him again...

1091
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:43,340
Enter the star of the show.

1092
00:13:43,340 --> 00:13:44,800
I see, I see...

1093
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:50,200
The hour of awakening has arrived.

1094
00:13:52,300 --> 00:13:53,800
The hour...

1095
00:13:54,500 --> 00:13:55,920
of awakening...

1096
00:13:56,820 --> 00:13:57,690
has arrived!

1097
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:15,630
Such immense magical energy...

1098
00:14:15,630 --> 00:14:18,000
He's holding his own against Queen Elisabeth?!

1099
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,410
Shadow...

1100
00:14:19,410 --> 00:14:21,800
He certainly is more powerful 
than the Witch of Calamity.

1101
00:14:22,340 --> 00:14:23,050
That's strange...

1102
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:27,760
Why is he taking time to entertain himself 
with an exchange of blows?

1103
00:14:28,190 --> 00:14:31,730
He's already within easy striking range.

1104
00:14:31,890 --> 00:14:33,890
Lord Shadow 
could take her out in a singleâ

1105
00:14:35,900 --> 00:14:37,160
Nami!

1106
00:14:39,810 --> 00:14:41,110
No...

1107
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:43,600
I don't believe it, Lord Shadow...

1108
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,600
Are you shielding us from her onslaught?

1109
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:49,390
Knowing that we're helpless against her?

1110
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:52,200
It doesn't matter the weight of the load.

1111
00:14:52,700 --> 00:14:55,200
I can't afford to lose a single one.

1112
00:14:57,110 --> 00:14:58,590
Lord Shadow!

1113
00:14:58,590 --> 00:15:02,630
I see the noble benevolence of your heart, 
shining like glittering gold!

1114
00:15:04,590 --> 00:15:07,050
I can't afford to lose a single one.

1115
00:15:07,610 --> 00:15:11,200
Lord Shadow, 
is that how deeply you care for me?

1116
00:15:11,900 --> 00:15:14,270
Then Beta has nothing more to say.

1117
00:15:14,610 --> 00:15:16,230
No more...

1118
00:15:16,500 --> 00:15:20,190
I pray for your victory! 
You can do it, Lord Shadow!

1119
00:15:20,510 --> 00:15:22,650
I can't afford...

1120
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:24,360
You can do it!

1121
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:26,320
...to lose...

1122
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:30,670
I believe in you, Lord Shadow!

1123
00:15:30,670 --> 00:15:31,790
...any more!

1124
00:15:59,540 --> 00:16:01,300
That's the great Shadow!

1125
00:16:01,300 --> 00:16:03,000
What a fearsome sight!

1126
00:16:03,500 --> 00:16:06,410
What does he think he's doing, 
flying in the sky?

1127
00:16:06,410 --> 00:16:07,500
Indeed.

1128
00:16:07,810 --> 00:16:10,400
He is quite the surprising individual.

1129
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:31,220
Tonight's game has gone on 
long enough, Your Majesty.

1130
00:16:32,210 --> 00:16:36,480
Would you be so kind 
as to tell me your name, my good sir?

1131
00:16:40,590 --> 00:16:41,600
I...

1132
00:16:42,310 --> 00:16:43,150
am...

1133
00:16:43,150 --> 00:16:45,900
No! Please, wait!

1134
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:50,420
Queen Elisabeth!

1135
00:16:52,380 --> 00:16:54,300
...Recovery Atomic.

1136
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:02,420
Quinton!

1137
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:17,900
She'll be all right now.

1138
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:24,480
On the other hand, I am nowhere near all right.

1139
00:17:26,010 --> 00:17:28,400
Eta's going to have a field day with this.

1140
00:17:30,420 --> 00:17:32,000
The Haven...

1141
00:17:32,790 --> 00:17:35,400
A place where you can be 
with the ones you love.

1142
00:17:36,370 --> 00:17:38,810
We're leaving, Number 666.

1143
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:48,800
What'd that punk call 
his gang again? Shadow Garden?

1144
00:17:49,210 --> 00:17:53,100
I'm thinking it could be fun 
to go pick a fight with them.

1145
00:17:54,460 --> 00:17:56,840
Our rise to adulthood...

1146
00:17:56,840 --> 00:17:59,730
We should consider ourselves lucky 
we're still alive.

1147
00:18:00,140 --> 00:18:01,790
My sword, my armor...

1148
00:18:01,790 --> 00:18:03,400
I lost it all.

1149
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:05,690
Consider yourself lucky 
you made it out alive.

1150
00:18:16,130 --> 00:18:18,420
<i>Ghouls, vampires, the possessed...</i>

1151
00:18:18,420 --> 00:18:22,580
<i>They all have different names, 
but in the end, they're all just magic overload.</i>

1152
00:18:23,340 --> 00:18:25,250
<i>Curing it is easy.</i>

1153
00:18:25,250 --> 00:18:29,550
<i>But there are afflictions out there 
that can't be cured.</i>

1154
00:18:31,590 --> 00:18:34,100
My left arm is tingling.

1155
00:18:34,100 --> 00:18:37,550
It's true, I have special powers.

1156
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:43,000
Is my blood destiny 
trying to lead me somewhere?

1157
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:51,500
<i>Bandages, magic circles, special powers...</i>

1158
00:18:51,500 --> 00:18:55,030
<i>You guessed it, my sister has got it bad.</i><i></i>

1159
00:18:55,750 --> 00:18:59,090
<i>But I can't dismiss her pain, 
because I, tooâ</i><i></i>

1160
00:18:59,090 --> 00:19:03,000
<i>No, all children have walked 
this path at some point.</i>

1161
00:19:03,710 --> 00:19:08,200
<i>And brushing off a child's concerns 
is what drives them to delinquency.</i>

1162
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:09,500
Cid...

1163
00:19:11,590 --> 00:19:13,000
I should tell you...

1164
00:19:13,810 --> 00:19:15,500
The thing is...

1165
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:21,000
there are special powers 
that have taken root in my left hand.

1166
00:19:22,170 --> 00:19:23,380
And I...

1167
00:19:23,910 --> 00:19:27,210
I have to solve the mystery of these powers.

1168
00:19:27,210 --> 00:19:28,810
I know you'll be fine, Sis.

1169
00:19:30,500 --> 00:19:34,570
No matter what path you follow, 
I'll be behind you all the way.

1170
00:19:40,800 --> 00:19:43,300
Thank you, Cid.

1171
00:19:56,600 --> 00:20:01,310
Cid, do you know about him? Shadow?

1172
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:04,880
The guy who burned down our school?

1173
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:06,400
Why do you ask?

1174
00:20:09,790 --> 00:20:11,000
Never mind.

1175
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:17,200
<i>I'm sure my sister has all kinds of trials 
and tribulations ahead of her.</i>

1176
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:22,900
<i>She'll have to confront 
her anxiety, her pain, reality.</i>

1177
00:20:22,900 --> 00:20:26,290
<i>But her left hand has started tingling, 
so there's nothing we can do about it.</i>

1178
00:20:27,300 --> 00:20:31,000
<i>Because that's how 
children grow into adults.</i>

1179
00:20:32,900 --> 00:20:36,910
<i>We've been through a lot, 
but this event is now over.</i>

1180
00:20:36,910 --> 00:20:39,600
<i>I struggled with a few unforeseen setbacks,</i>

1181
00:20:39,600 --> 00:20:42,900
<i>but let's just say, 
"All's well that ends well."</i>

1182
00:20:44,710 --> 00:20:48,190
<i>Alas, I never managed 
to recover all the gold coins.</i>

1183
00:20:48,910 --> 00:20:53,210
<i>I was supposed to have three thousand, 
but the next thing I knew, there were only five hundred left.</i>

1184
00:20:53,210 --> 00:20:55,810
<i>With the current exchange rate, 
that's only 50 million zeni.</i>

1185
00:20:55,810 --> 00:20:58,150
<i>Not nearly enough 
to support me my whole life.</i>

1186
00:20:58,800 --> 00:21:02,910
<i>But if you think about it, 
maybe this is plenty.</i>

1187
00:21:02,910 --> 00:21:06,370
<i>After all, the Lawless City 
will always be here,</i>

1188
00:21:06,370 --> 00:21:08,200
<i>and there are still two towers standing.</i>

1189
00:21:08,630 --> 00:21:11,710
<i>If I'm ever in financial straits, 
I can just come back.</i>

1190
00:21:12,820 --> 00:21:14,600
<i>Because the Lawless City...</i>

1191
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:17,800
<i>is my piggy bank.</i>

